-- =====================================================================
-- Session 156 — Matt 24 extras-tier cross-references (single chapter)
-- =====================================================================
-- Adds Matt 24's extras-tier rows + threads to the cross-reference
-- corpus. Continues the S131 (Matt 1-2) -> S155 (Matt 23) extras-tier
-- coverage; Matt 24 lands as the Olivet-discourse opening — the King-
-- of-Yashar''el (Israel)''s fifth-major-discourse and the most-
-- substantial load-bearing eschatological-architecture in the Matthean
-- gospel, walked-out from the Mount of Olives in answer to the
-- disciples'' three-fold question on the way out of the Second-Temple
-- precinct the King has just-departed at the close of Matthew 23''s
-- lament. Five framework-bearing narrative movements anchor the
-- chapter:
--
--   (a) the Temple-prophecy and the three-fold question on the Mount
--       of Olives (vv.1-3) — the King''s-prophecy *there shall not be
--       left here one stone upon another, that shall not be thrown
--       down* walking the Tanakh-Temple-judgment-pattern the prophet-
--       Yirmeyahu (Jeremiah) at Jeremiah 7:1-15 + 26:6-9, 18 and the
--       prophet-Mikhah (Micah) at Micah 3:12 walked; the substantial-
--       Mount-of-Olives setting the prophet-Yechezk''el (Ezekiel) walked
--       at the Shekinah-departure-substance of Ezekiel 11:22-23 and
--       the prophet-Zecharyah (Zechariah) walked at Zechariah 14:4 as
--       the mountain the Father''s-feet shall-stand-upon at the
--       substantial-second-coming.
--   (b) the beginning-of-sorrows and apostolic-persecution and the
--       gospel-of-the-kingdom-witness-to-all-the-nations (vv.4-14) —
--       the substantial-deception-substance walking the five-Judaizer-
--       costumes-architecture; the substantial Tanakh-birth-pangs-
--       substance the prophets-Yeshayahu (Isaiah) and Yirmeyahu
--       (Jeremiah) and Mikhah (Micah) walked; the framework-major
--       *because iniquity (Greek anomia, torahlessness) shall abound,
--       the love of many shall wax cold* substance at v.12 walking the
--       substantial-direct-diagnostic of the substantial-modern-
--       antinomian-gospel; the *he that shall endure unto the end, the
--       same shall be saved* substance against the inherited-
--       Reformation-eternal-security-substance; the *this gospel of
--       the kingdom shall be preached in all the world for a witness
--       unto all nations* substance walking the broad-proclamation-
--       substance among the nations where the lost-sheep of the house
--       of Yashar''el (Israel) is-scattered per Red Line #11.
--   (c) the abomination-of-desolation and the great-tribulation and
--       the false-Messiahs and the lightning-from-east-to-west (vv.15-
--       28) — the King citing *Daniel the prophet* directly, the
--       Antiochus-IV-Epiphanes-substance of 167 BCE prefiguring per
--       1 Maccabees 1:54-60 and 2 Maccabees 6:1-9, the substantial-
--       future-substance walking-into the man-of-sin of 2 Thessalonians
--       2:3-4 and the beast-substance of Revelation 11:1-2 + 13:5-18;
--       the *flee into the mountains* substance walking the Pella-
--       flight prefiguring of pre-70-CE; the substantial Shabbat
--       (Sabbath)-substance preserved-at-the-future-substance; the
--       substantial *lightning out of the east, and shineth even unto
--       the west* substance ruling-out the secret-rapture-substance.
--   (d) FRAMEWORK-MAJOR — the cosmic-signs and the coming of the Son
--       of Adam and the gathering of the elect (vv.29-31) —
--       *immediately after the tribulation of those days* ruling-out
--       the pre-tribulation-rapture-substance; the Tanakh-Day of
--       Yahuah (the LORD) cluster the prophets-Yeshayahu (Isaiah) and
--       Yo''el (Joel) and Yechezk''el (Ezekiel) and Amos and Mikhah
--       (Micah) and Tsefanyah (Zephaniah) walked; the *sign of the Son
--       of Adam in heaven* + *all the tribes of the earth shall mourn*
--       substance walking Zechariah 12:10-14''s *they shall look upon
--       me whom they have pierced*; the *Son of Adam coming in the
--       clouds of heaven with power and great glory* substance walking
--       Daniel 7:13-14 (with the kaph-comparative narrow-rule preserved
--       at Daniel 7:13 and Revelation 1:13 + 14:14 but the Greek at
--       Matthew 24:30 NOT carrying the *hōs* / *homoion* comparative —
--       reads as the title *the Son of Adam* directly); the *great
--       sound of a trumpet* substance walking the Yom Teru''ah (Feast
--       of Trumpets) substance and Isaiah 27:13''s great-trumpet
--       gathering of the substantial-outcasts; the *gather together
--       his elect from the four winds, from one end of heaven to the
--       other* substance — THE central Red Line #11 four-winds-
--       gathering verse, walking the substantial Tanakh-gathering-of-
--       the-twelve-tribes-of-Yashar''el (Israel) the prophets walked at
--       Deuteronomy 30:1-4 + Isaiah 11:11-12 + Isaiah 27:12-13 +
--       Jeremiah 23:3 + Jeremiah 31:8-10 + Ezekiel 11:17 + Ezekiel
--       20:34, 41 + Ezekiel 34:11-16 + Ezekiel 36:24 + Ezekiel 37:21 +
--       Hosea 1:10-11 + Micah 2:12 + Micah 4:6-7 + Zephaniah 3:19-20 +
--       Zechariah 8:7-8 + Zechariah 10:8-10. The elect are the
--       substantial-paternal-blood-remnant-of-the-twelve-tribes
--       preserved-from-the-foundation-of-the-world per Revelation 13:8
--       and Revelation 17:8, NOT the substantial-spiritual-category-
--       substance the substantial-Christian-inclusion-gospel walks.
--   (e) the days-of-Noach (Noah) and the watchfulness and the
--       faithful-and-evil-servant (vv.32-51) — the Genesis 6:1-13
--       Watcher-rebellion-substance the substantial Adam-and-the-tares-
--       architecture walks per 1 Enoch 6-9 the apostle-Yehudah (Jude)
--       quotes at Jude 14-15 + 2 Peter 2:5 + 2 Peter 3:3-7; the *one
--       shall be taken, and the other left* substance walking the
--       Lukan-parallel of Luke 17:34-37 (the disciples'' *where, Lord?*
--       receiving *wheresoever the body is, thither will the eagles be
--       gathered together* — the substantial-judgment-substance, NOT
--       the substantial-modern-Christian-pre-tribulation-rapture-
--       rescue-substance); the framework-major *of that day and hour
--       knoweth no man, no, not the angels of heaven, but my Father
--       only* substance preserving the Formless-Source / Formed-
--       Expression substance ruling-out both Trinitarian-three-co-
--       equal-persons substance AND modalist-collapse substance; the
--       faithful-and-wise-servant substance walking the substantial-
--       stewardship-substance against the inherited-Reformation-
--       eternal-security-substance, the *cut him asunder, and appoint
--       him his portion with the hypocrites* substance walking the
--       substantial-loss-substance per Ezekiel 18:24.
--
-- Matt 24 reading-target: the chapter walks five movements with the
-- Tanakh-substance carrying the heaviest framework-bearing anchors
-- directly. The extras-library adds five framework-bearing thread-
-- clusters:
--   Thread 1 (FRAMEWORK-MAJOR): 1 Enoch + Jubilees on the days-of-
--     Noach (Noah) / Watcher-rebellion / antediluvian-judgment-pattern
--     substance — the wisdom-stream''s articulation of the architecture
--     the King walks at vv.37-39 in continuity with Genesis 6:1-13.
--   Thread 2 (FRAMEWORK-MAJOR): 1 Enoch''s Animal Apocalypse (ch 90)
--     + Parables-of-Enoch (ch 57, 61) on the gathering-of-the-elect
--     and the lightning-from-east-to-west and the four-winds-gathering
--     substance — the wisdom-stream''s direct anchor for THE central
--     Red Line #11 four-winds-gathering verse at vv.27-31.
--   Thread 3 (FRAMEWORK-MAJOR): 2 Esdras (4 Ezra) on the signs-of-
--     the-end-of-the-age + tribulation-and-cosmic-signs + the Son
--     declared + the ten-tribes-gathered substance — the wisdom-
--     stream''s direct articulation of the architecture the King walks
--     at vv.7-31 with the ten-tribes-gathering-from-beyond-the-river
--     directly anchoring the four-winds-gathering substance.
--   Thread 4: Sirach (Ecclesiasticus) + Wisdom of Solomon on the
--     reward-according-to-works + post-harvest-sifting + day-of-
--     visitation substance — the wisdom-stream''s articulation of the
--     faithful-and-wise-servant architecture the King walks at vv.45-
--     51 against the inherited-Reformation-eternal-security-substance.
--   Thread 5: Testaments of the XII Patriarchs (Naphtali''s Mount-of-
--     Olives vision + Asher''s scattering-and-gathering substance) —
--     the wisdom-stream''s direct articulation of the Mount-of-Olives-
--     setting at v.3 AND the prophetic-gathering-of-the-twelve-tribes
--     substance at v.31, plus the Father''s-direct-visit substance the
--     incarnation-and-second-coming walk-into.
--
-- Jubilees 23''s last-days-iniquity-substance was considered but the
-- 1 Enoch + Jubilees-5 days-of-Noach (Noah) anchoring carries the
-- heavier framework-load at the Matt-24:37-39 anchor; Jubilees 23
-- thread-substance is deferred to a future Matthew chapter where it
-- carries primary load. Ascension of Isaiah 4''s Beliar-in-the-form-of-
-- a-man / lawless-king substance was considered as a sixth Matt-24:15
-- abomination-architecture thread but five-thread cap per session
-- contract; AI 4''s substance is deferred. Historical-witness editions
-- (Josephus, M.R. James, Lightfoot) remain deferred from V1 cross-refs
-- per the historical-witness one-way rule.
--
-- Levi 16-18''s Messianic-priest substance was considered for thread 5
-- but the apocrypha-vol2 (Charles) edition''s Testaments-XII has Levi
-- bounded at chapter 12 (Levi Chapter 1-12); the standard Levi 16-18
-- chapters do not exist in this edition. The Naphtali-and-Asher
-- substance carries the framework-load at the chapters that do exist.
--
-- Five PROPOSED threads at extras-tier:
--   1. `the-days-of-noach-and-the-watcher-rebellion-judgment-pattern-in-1-enoch-and-jubilees`        (sort 342)
--   2. `the-gathering-of-the-elect-from-the-four-winds-in-1-enochs-animal-apocalypse-and-parables`   (sort 343)
--   3. `the-signs-of-the-end-and-the-ten-tribes-gathered-in-2-esdras`                                (sort 344)
--   4. `the-faithful-and-wise-servant-and-the-day-of-visitation-in-sirach-and-wisdom-of-solomon`     (sort 345)
--   5. `the-mount-of-olives-vision-and-the-gathering-of-the-tribes-in-testaments-of-naphtali-and-asher` (sort 346)
--
-- 21 new cross_references rows at tier_required=''extras'' (Library
-- tier, $4.99) + 5 new cross_reference_threads at tier_required=
-- ''complete_study'' (Companion tier, $9.99). The tier split honors the
-- chapter-end-card architecture established at S146 and prior: Layer 1
-- (per-verse cross-refs) visible to Library readers; Layer 2 (framework
-- thread callouts with summary_md + member_notes) gated at Companion.
-- Every member-note passes the 12 Red Lines and the 12-point editorial
-- checklist. The seed-mechanism per framework-deep''s *Paternal Seed
-- and the Marriage-Covenant Absorption* section + Red Line #7
-- augmentation does not surface in Matt 24 (no foreign-origin
-- individuals or marriage-covenant-absorption substance in the
-- chapter — the chapter is the disciples-on-the-Mount-of-Olives and
-- the broader-eschatological-architecture). Red Line #11''s four-
-- winds-gathering substance is the central anchor of threads 2, 3,
-- and 5. Red Line #12''s Son-of-Adam restoration is preserved
-- throughout — note that at Matt 24:30 the Greek does NOT carry the
-- kaph-comparative ( *ton huion tou anthrōpou erchomenon*, no
-- *homoion* ); the kaph-comparative narrow-rule applies only at
-- Daniel 7:13 + Revelation 1:13 + Revelation 14:14. Hebrew names with
-- internal apostrophes (Yashar''el, Ya''aqov, Yechezk''el, Yo''el,
-- Sha''ul, Yahudah''s, Yahusha''s, King''s, Father''s, etc.) and English
-- possessives (wisdom-stream''s, master''s, Father''s, King''s, system''s,
-- people''s, etc.) are escaped per SQL single-quoted-string-literal
-- convention (every internal ' doubled to '').
--
-- Idempotent: ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING on every INSERT.
-- =====================================================================

\echo 'Session 156 — Matt 24 extras-tier cross-references migration starting...'
BEGIN;

-- Verse-lookup temp view. Mirrors the S154 view; retained for forward
-- compatibility even though Matt 24 surfaces only canon + enoch +
-- apocrypha + jubilees + pseudepigrapha at S156.
CREATE TEMP VIEW _s156_xref_lookup AS
SELECT
    e.slug AS edition_slug,
    b.slug AS book_slug,
    c.chapter_number,
    v.verse_number,
    v.id AS verse_id
  FROM verses v
  JOIN chapters c ON v.chapter_id = c.id
  JOIN books    b ON c.book_id    = b.id
  JOIN editions e ON b.edition_id = e.id
 WHERE e.slug IN (
       'canon',
       'enoch',
       'jubilees',
       'jasher',
       'apocrypha',
       'apocrypha-charles-vol1',
       'pseudepigrapha',
       'adam-eve-conflict',
       'apocalypse-of-abraham',
       'ascension-isaiah',
       'sonnini-acts-29'
   );

-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------
-- Insert 21 extras-tier cross_references rows.
