  -- Thread 1: the-days-of-noach-and-the-watcher-rebellion-judgment-pattern-in-1-enoch-and-jubilees
  ('canon', 'matthew', 24, 37, 'enoch', '1-enoch', 10, 2,
   '*And said to him: Go to Noah and tell him in My Name "Hide thyself!" and reveal to him the end that is approaching: that the whole earth will be destroyed, and a deluge is about to come upon the whole earth.* 1 Enoch 10:2 names THE direct wisdom-stream verbal-anchor for the proclamation-to-Noach (Noah) substance the King walks at Matt 24:37 — *as the days of Noach (Noah) were, so shall also the coming of the Son of Adam be.* The framework reads the verse against the substantial-Watcher-rebellion-architecture 1 Enoch 6-9 walks the substantial-Genesis 6:1-4 substance into, the substance the apostle-Yehudah (Jude) quotes at Jude 14-15 and the apostle-Kefa (Peter) walks at 2 Peter 2:5 and 2 Peter 3:3-7. The substantial *as the days of Noach (Noah) were* substance the King names is the substantial-Watcher-rebellion-substance-prefiguring-the-substantial-end-of-the-age architecture — the substantial-corruption-of-the-substantial-flesh-substance the Watchers walked, the substantial-Nephilim (giants) corruption, the substantial-judgment-by-flood the substantial-substance walked into. 1 Enoch 10:2 names the substantial-direct-substance the Father-substance walked the substantial-proclamation-to-Noach (Noah) at the substantial-pre-flood-substance the King''s Matt 24:37 substance recapitulates. FRAMEWORK-MAJOR.'),

  ('canon', 'matthew', 24, 38, 'enoch', '1-enoch', 65, 11,
   '*But the Most High shall send His punishment Upon the sinners and upon the fallen angels, And upon their children.* 1 Enoch 65:11 names the wisdom-stream''s direct articulation of the punishment-upon-the-sinners-and-the-fallen-angels-and-their-children substance — the substantial-three-category-judgment-architecture the days-of-Noach (Noah) walked at the substantial-flood-substance. The framework reads the verse against Matt 24:38''s *as in the days that were before the flood they were eating and drinking, marrying and giving in marriage, until the day that Noach (Noah) entered into the ark.* The substantial *eating and drinking, marrying and giving in marriage* substance is the substantial-unawareness-substance the substantial-Watcher-rebellion-corruption-substance had-walked-into; 1 Enoch 65:11 names the substantial-three-category-judgment that walked-out of the substantial-corruption-substance. The framework reads this in continuity with Genesis 6:1-4''s Bene ha-Elohim-and-the-daughters-of-Adam substance — the substantial-paternal-corruption-of-the-substantial-flesh-substance the substantial-Watchers walked-against-the-substantial-creation-order the Father-substance had-established.'),

  ('canon', 'matthew', 24, 39, 'enoch', '1-enoch', 67, 1,
   '*And in those days the punishment of the fallen angels shall be consummated, And they shall be led off to the abyss of fire: And in the fire shall they be covered.* 1 Enoch 67:1 names the wisdom-stream articulation of the consummation-of-the-punishment-of-the-fallen-angels substance — the substantial-final-substance the substantial-Watcher-rebellion-substance walks-into-the-substantial-abyss-of-fire. The framework reads the verse against Matt 24:39''s *and knew not until the flood came, and took them all away.* The substantial *took them all away* (Greek *ēren hapantas*) substance is the substantial-judgment-substance, NOT the substantial-rescue-substance the substantial-modern-Christian-pre-tribulation-rapture-substance walks. The substantial-flood-substance took-the-substantial-wicked-and-the-substantial-Watcher-corruption-substance away in-the-substantial-judgment-substance; 1 Enoch 67:1 names the substantial-consummation-of-the-substantial-Watcher-rebellion-substance the substantial-flood-substance prefigured.'),

  ('canon', 'matthew', 24, 37, 'jubilees', 'jubilees', 5, 2,
   '*And lawlessness increased on the earth and all flesh corrupted its way, alike men and cattle and beasts and birds and everything that walks on the earth — all of them corrupted their ways and their orders.* Jubilees 5:2 names the direct wisdom-stream verbal-anchor for the substantial-lawlessness-increased substance the days-of-Noach (Noah) walked at the substantial-Watcher-rebellion-substance — the same Greek-anomia / torahlessness substance the King walks at Matt 24:12 (*and because iniquity (anomia, torahlessness) shall abound, the love of many shall wax cold*) ties-forward-to. The framework reads the verse against Matt 24:37 — the *as the days of Noach (Noah) were* substance the King names is the substantial-lawlessness-substance the substantial-Watcher-corruption-substance walked-the-substantial-flesh-substance into. Jubilees 5:2 names the substantial-direct-substance the days-of-Noach (Noah) walked: lawlessness-on-the-earth and corruption-of-the-flesh of all-orders-of-creation. The substantial-modern-period walks the substantial-same-substance — the substantial-lawlessness-substance of the substantial-anomia-substance the substantial-modern-institutional-Christianity walks (*we are not under the law but under grace,* the substantial-truncated-Reformation-grammar that-pits-grace-against-the-Torah the apostle-Sha''ul (Paul) never-walked).'),

  ('canon', 'matthew', 24, 38, 'jubilees', 'jubilees', 5, 19,
   '*And as for all those who corrupted their ways and their thoughts before the flood, no man''s person was accepted save that of Noach (Noah) alone; for his person was accepted in behalf of his sons, whom Elohim (God) saved from the waters of the flood on his account.* Jubilees 5:19 names the wisdom-stream articulation of the no-man''s-person-was-accepted-save-Noach (Noah) substance the substantial-flood-substance walked-into. The framework reads the verse against Matt 24:38-40 — the substantial *one shall be taken, and the other left* substance the King walks at v.40 walks the substantial-pattern Jubilees 5:19 names the architecture for: the substantial-substance accepted-in-the-substantial-Father''s-substance walks-into-the-substantial-preservation-substance, the substantial-substance not-accepted walks-into-the-substantial-judgment-substance the substantial-flood took-away. The framework reads the *one taken* substance per the substantial-Lukan-parallel of Luke 17:34-37 — the disciples''-substance asks *where, Lord?* and the King-of-Yashar''el (Israel) answers *wheresoever the body is, thither will the eagles be gathered together* — the substantial *taken* substance walks-into-the-substantial-judgment, NOT the substantial-rescue the substantial-modern-Christian-pre-tribulation-rapture-substance walks.'),

  -- Thread 2: the-gathering-of-the-elect-from-the-four-winds-in-1-enochs-animal-apocalypse-and-parables
  ('canon', 'matthew', 24, 27, 'enoch', '1-enoch', 57, 1,
