  -- Thread 3: the-signs-of-the-end-and-the-ten-tribes-gathered-in-2-esdras
  ('canon', 'matthew', 24, 10, 'apocrypha', '2-esdras', 5, 1,
   '*Nevertheless as concerning the tokens, behold, the days shall come, that they which dwell upon earth shall be taken in a great number, and the way of truth shall be hidden, and the land shall be barren of faith.* 2 Esdras (4 Ezra) 5:1 names THE direct wisdom-stream verbal-anchor for the signs-of-the-end-of-the-age substance the King walks at the substantial Matt 24 discourse. The framework reads the verse against Matt 24:10-12 — *and then shall many be offended, and shall betray one another, and shall hate one another... and because iniquity (Greek anomia, torahlessness) shall abound, the love of many shall wax cold.* The substantial *way of truth shall be hidden* substance is the substantial-substance the substantial-torahlessness-substance walks-the-substantial-period through; the substantial *land shall be barren of faith* substance is the substantial-cause-and-effect of the substantial-torahlessness — the substantial-faith-substance walks-from the substantial-keep-of-the-commandments-substance the apostle-Yochanan (John) walks at 1 John 5:3 (*for this is the love of Elohim (God), that we keep his commandments: and his commandments are not grievous*); when the substantial-torahlessness abounds, the substantial-faith-substance fails. FRAMEWORK-MAJOR.'),

  ('canon', 'matthew', 24, 29, 'apocrypha', '2-esdras', 5, 4,
   '*But if the Most High grant you to live, you shall see after the third trumpet that the sun shall suddenly shine again in the night, and the moon thrice in the day.* 2 Esdras (4 Ezra) 5:4 names the wisdom-stream articulation of the cosmic-signs substance — the sun-and-moon-and-stars-substance disordered-at-the-day-of-Yahuah (the LORD) substance. The framework reads the verse against Matt 24:29''s *immediately after the tribulation of those days shall the sun be darkened, and the moon shall not give her light, and the stars shall fall from heaven.* The substantial-cosmic-signs walk the substantial Tanakh-Day of Yahuah (the LORD) cluster the prophets-Yeshayahu (Isaiah) and Yo''el (Joel) and Yechezk''el (Ezekiel) and Amos and Mikhah (Micah) and Tsefanyah (Zephaniah) walked at Isaiah 13:10 and Joel 2:10 + 2:31 and Ezekiel 32:7-8 and Amos 5:18-20 and Amos 8:9 and Micah 3:6 and Zephaniah 1:14-18; 2 Esdras 5:4 names the wisdom-stream''s direct articulation of the substantial-cosmic-disordering at the substantial-end-of-the-age. The substance the King names walks IMMEDIATELY-AFTER the substantial-tribulation, the substantial-direct-rule-out of the substantial-pre-tribulation-rapture-substance.'),

  ('canon', 'matthew', 24, 10, 'apocrypha', '2-esdras', 5, 9,
   '*And salt waters shall be found in the sweet, and all friends shall destroy one another; then shall wit hide itself, and understanding withdraw itself into his secret chamber.* 2 Esdras (4 Ezra) 5:9 names the wisdom-stream articulation of the all-friends-destroy-one-another substance — the substantial-internal-betrayal-substance the substantial-pressure-of-the-tribulation generates. The framework reads the verse against Matt 24:10''s *and then shall many be offended, and shall betray one another, and shall hate one another.* The substantial-substance the apostle-Sha''ul (Paul) walks at 2 Timothy 4:10 (*for Demas hath forsaken me, having loved this present world*) and 2 Timothy 4:16 (*at my first answer no man stood with me, but all men forsook me*) is the substantial-substance the substantial-pressure walks-out into the substantial-community; 2 Esdras 5:9 had named the substantial-architecture at the substantial-wisdom-stream-register.'),

  ('canon', 'matthew', 24, 30, 'apocrypha', '2-esdras', 13, 32,
   '*And the time shall be when these things shall come to pass, and the signs shall happen which I shewed you before, and then shall my Son be declared, whom you sawest as a man ascending.* 2 Esdras (4 Ezra) 13:32 names THE direct wisdom-stream verbal-anchor for the substantial *then shall my Son be declared* substance the King walks at Matt 24:30 — *and then shall appear the sign of the Son of Adam in heaven... and they shall see the Son of Adam coming in the clouds of heaven with power and great glory.* The framework reads the verse against the substantial Daniel 7:13-14 substance — at Matt 24:30 the Greek does NOT carry the *hōs* / *homoion* comparative and reads as the title *the Son of Adam* directly (the kaph-comparative narrow-rule preserved only at Daniel 7:13 + Revelation 1:13 + Revelation 14:14 per Red Line #12''s harmonized treatment); the King walks-himself-as-the-substantial-Son-of-Adam coming-in-the-clouds. 2 Esdras 13:32 had named the substantial-architecture at the substantial-pseudepigraphic-register the substantial-pattern of the substantial-signs preceding-the-substantial-declaration-of-the-substantial-Son. FRAMEWORK-MAJOR.'),

  ('canon', 'matthew', 24, 31, 'apocrypha', '2-esdras', 13, 39,
   '*And whereas you sawest that he gathered another peaceable multitude to him.* 2 Esdras (4 Ezra) 13:39 names the direct wisdom-stream verbal-anchor for the gathering-another-peaceable-multitude substance — the substantial-ten-tribes-of-the-house-of-Yashar''el (Israel) the substantial-2 Esdras 13:40-47 unit identifies. The framework reads the verse against Matt 24:31''s substantial-gathering-of-the-elect-from-the-four-winds. 2 Esdras 13:40-47 unfolds: the substantial-ten-tribes-of-the-house-of-Yashar''el (Israel) carried-away by the substantial-Salmanasar (Shalmaneser) king-of-Ashshur (Assyria), the substantial-substance walking-through-the-substantial-waters into the substantial-further-country, the substantial-Most-High staying-the-springs-of-the-substantial-stream-again-so-they-may-go-through-back at the substantial-end-of-the-age. The substantial-substance is the substantial-direct-wisdom-stream-corroboration of the substantial-paternal-blood-remnant-of-the-twelve-tribes the prophets walked the substantial-ingathering substance for. FRAMEWORK-MAJOR per Red Line #11.'),

  -- Thread 4: the-faithful-and-wise-servant-and-the-day-of-visitation-in-sirach-and-wisdom-of-solomon
  ('canon', 'matthew', 24, 46, 'apocrypha', 'ecclesiasticus', 11, 26,
   '*For it is an easy thing to Yahuah (God) in the day of death to reward a man according to his ways.* Sirach (Ecclesiasticus) 11:26 names the direct wisdom-stream verbal-anchor for the reward-according-to-his-ways substance. The framework reads the verse against Matt 24:46''s *blessed is that servant, whom his lord when he cometh shall find so doing.* The substantial *find so doing* substance is the substantial-substance the substantial-faithful-and-wise-servant walks at the substantial-day-of-the-lord''s-return; the substantial-reward-substance is according-to-the-substantial-ways-the-substantial-servant has-walked-through-the-substantial-period of the substantial-lord''s-delay. Sirach 11:26 had named the substantial-architecture at the substantial-wisdom-stream-register: the substantial-substance walks the substantial-reward-substance the substantial-substance receives at the substantial-day-of-death-substance the substantial-substance had-walked-toward through the substantial-life-substance.'),

  ('canon', 'matthew', 24, 47, 'apocrypha', 'ecclesiasticus', 16, 14,
