  ('canon', 'matthew', 24, 51, 'apocrypha', 'ecclesiasticus', 27, 4,
   '*As when one sifteth with a sieve, the refuse remains; so the filth of man in his talk.* Sirach (Ecclesiasticus) 27:4 names the wisdom-stream articulation of the sieve-and-the-refuse-remaining substance — the substantial-post-harvest-sifting architecture the substantial-substance the chaff-from-the-wheat substance walks per Matthew 3:12 (*whose fan is in his hand, and he will throughly purge his floor, and gather his wheat into the garner; but he will burn up the chaff with unquenchable fire*). The framework reads the verse against Matt 24:51''s *and shall cut him asunder, and appoint him his portion with the hypocrites: there shall be weeping and gnashing of teeth.* The substantial-evil-servant-substance is the substantial-substance had-been-trusted-with-the-substantial-stewardship and walked-into-the-substantial-loss-substance through-the-substantial-presumption — the substantial-substance the prophet-Yechezk''el (Ezekiel) walked at Ezekiel 18:24 (*but when the righteous turneth away from his righteousness, and committeth iniquity... shall he live? All his righteousness that he hath done shall not be mentioned*). Sirach 27:4 names the substantial-substance the wisdom-stream walks: the substantial-sieve-and-the-refuse-remaining substance is the substantial-post-harvest-sifting that the substantial-presumption-of-the-substantial-stewardship walks-through.'),

  ('canon', 'matthew', 24, 46, 'apocrypha', 'the-wisdom-of-solomon', 3, 7,
   '*And in the time of their visitation they shall shine, and run to and fro like sparks among the stubble.* Wisdom of Solomon 3:7 names the wisdom-stream articulation of the time-of-visitation substance — the substantial-day-of-the-substantial-Father''s-visiting-of-the-substantial-righteous. The framework reads the verse against Matt 24:46''s *blessed is that servant, whom his lord when he cometh shall find so doing.* The substantial *time of their visitation* substance is the substantial-day-of-the-substantial-lord''s-coming the King walks at v.42-46; the substantial-faithful-and-wise-servant walking-the-substantial-stewardship-substance at-the-substantial-time-of-the-substantial-visitation walks-into-the-substantial-shining-substance Wisdom of Solomon 3:7 names. The framework reads this in continuity with Daniel 12:3 (*and they that be wise shall shine as the brightness of the firmament; and they that turn many to righteousness as the stars for ever and ever*) and Matthew 13:43 (*then shall the righteous shine forth as the sun in the kingdom of their Father*) — the substantial-shining-substance is the substantial-substance the substantial-righteous-walked-the-substantial-Way-substance into the substantial-time-of-the-substantial-visitation.'),

  -- Thread 5: the-mount-of-olives-vision-and-the-gathering-of-the-tribes-in-testaments-of-naphtali-and-asher
  ('canon', 'matthew', 24, 3, 'pseudepigrapha', 'testaments-xii', 55, 1,
   '*For in the fortieth year of my life, I saw a vision on the Mount of Olives, on the east of Jerusalem.* Testaments of the XII Patriarchs (Naphtali 4:1) names THE direct wisdom-stream verbal-anchor for the Mount-of-Olives setting the King walks at Matt 24:3 — *and as he sat upon the mount of Olives, the disciples came unto him privately.* The framework reads the verse as the substantial-direct-corroboration that the substantial Mount-of-Olives-substance is the substantial-substance-of-the-substantial-prophetic-vision-substance the substantial-patriarchs-walked the substantial-vision-of-the-substantial-end-of-the-age-substance from. The substantial Mount-of-Olives is the substantial-mountain the Shekinah-substance the prophet-Yechezk''el (Ezekiel) walked at Ezekiel 11:22-23 had-departed-over at the substantial First-Temple-judgment-substance and the substantial-mountain the prophet-Zecharyah (Zechariah) walked at Zechariah 14:4 as the substantial-mountain the Father''s-feet shall-stand-upon at the substantial-second-coming; the substantial-Testaments-of-the-XII walks the substantial-substance at the substantial-patriarchal-vision-register the King walks at the substantial-Olivet-discourse-substance.'),

  ('canon', 'matthew', 24, 14, 'pseudepigrapha', 'testaments-xii', 57, 3,
   '*For through their tribes shall Elohim (God) appear, To save the race of Yashar''el (Israel), And to gather together the righteous from amongst the Gentiles.* Testaments of the XII Patriarchs (Naphtali 6:3) names the wisdom-stream articulation of the gather-together-the-righteous-from-amongst-the-Gentiles substance. The framework reads the verse against Matt 24:14''s *and this gospel of the kingdom shall be preached in all the world for a witness unto all nations; and then shall the end come.* The substantial *gather together the righteous from amongst the Gentiles* substance is the substantial-substance the substantial-paternal-blood-remnant-of-the-twelve-tribes-of-Yashar''el (Israel) walks the substantial-Lo-Ammi-substance the prophet-Hosheia (Hosea) walked at Hosea 1:10-11 — the substantial-scattered-seed-of-the-house-of-Yashar''el (Israel) living-as-Gentiles-among-the-nations the apostle-Sha''ul (Paul) walks at Romans 9:25-26. The substantial-substance is NOT the substantial-Christian-inclusion-gospel that-collapses the substantial-paternal-blood-remnant-of-the-twelve-tribes into-the-substantial-spiritual-category-open-to-anyone-who-confesses; the substantial *righteous from amongst the Gentiles* substance is the substantial-Lo-Ammi-scattered-seed the substantial-Father-substance is-calling-home-from-the-substantial-territories-of-the-substantial-dispersion-substance, the substantial-hearing-substance per John 10:26-27 (*my sheep hear my voice... ye believe not, because ye are not of my sheep*) revealing the substantial-citizens the substantial-Father had-named-from-the-substantial-foundation-of-the-world per Revelation 13:8 and Revelation 17:8. Per Red Line #11.'),

  ('canon', 'matthew', 24, 30, 'pseudepigrapha', 'testaments-xii', 70, 3,
   '*Until the Most High shall visit the earth, coming Himself as man, with men eating and drinking, and breaking the head of the dragon in the water. He shall save Yashar''el (Israel) and all the Gentiles.* Testaments of the XII Patriarchs (Asher 6:3) names the wisdom-stream articulation of the Most-High-shall-visit-the-earth-coming-Himself substance — the substantial-direct-Father-and-Son architecture per the framework''s Formless-Source / Formed-Expression substance. The framework reads the verse against Matt 24:30''s *they shall see the Son of Adam coming in the clouds of heaven with power and great glory.* The substantial *Most High shall visit the earth, coming Himself* substance is the substantial-substance the substantial Formed-Expression of the Formless-Source-substance walks-into-the-substantial-incarnation — the substantial-King-of-Yashar''el (Israel) is the substantial-Formed-Expression of the substantial-Formless-Source-substance the Father-substance is, the same Formed-Expression the substantial-Tanakh walked the substantial Adonai Yahuah (the Lord GOD) of the interactions-with-the-substantial-patriarchs-and-prophets. The substantial *with men eating and drinking* substance carries-back-into the substantial-Matt 24:38 *eating and drinking* substance the days-of-Noach (Noah) walked, the substantial-substance the incarnation-substance walks-into in continuity with the substantial-Father''s-presence-walking-with-the-substantial-Adamic-substance from the substantial-creation-substance forward.'),

  ('canon', 'matthew', 24, 31, 'pseudepigrapha', 'testaments-xii', 70, 7,
   '*But Yahuah (Lord) will gather you together in faith through His tender mercy, and for the sake of Avraham (Abraham), Yitschaq (Isaac), and Ya''aqov (Jacob).* Testaments of the XII Patriarchs (Asher 6:7) names THE direct wisdom-stream verbal-anchor for the Yahuah-will-gather-you-together substance the King walks at Matt 24:31. The framework reads the verse against the substantial-gathering-of-the-elect-from-the-four-winds substance. The substantial *for the sake of Avraham (Abraham), Yitschaq (Isaac), and Ya''aqov (Jacob)* substance ties-the-substantial-gathering-substance directly-to-the-substantial-paternal-blood-substance the Father had-walked the substantial-covenant-substance with-the-substantial-patriarchs from Genesis 12:1-3 + Genesis 26:3-5 + Genesis 28:13-15. The substantial-gathering-substance walks the substantial-paternal-blood-remnant-of-the-twelve-tribes the substantial-substance the prophets walked the substantial-ingathering-substance for at Deuteronomy 30:1-4 + Isaiah 11:11-12 + Jeremiah 31:8-10 + Ezekiel 37:21 + Hosea 1:10-11 + Zechariah 10:8-10 — NOT the substantial-spiritual-category-substance the substantial-Christian-inclusion-gospel walks. Per Red Line #11 the substantial-elect is the substantial-paternal-blood-remnant the substantial-Father preserves-and-gathers, not the substantial-spiritual-category-open-to-anyone-who-confesses.')

)
INSERT INTO cross_references (source_verse_id, target_verse_id, source, note, tier_required)
SELECT sv.verse_id, tv.verse_id, 'manual', i.note, 'extras'::content_tier
  FROM input i
  JOIN _s156_xref_lookup sv ON sv.edition_slug   = i.src_edition
                           AND sv.book_slug      = i.src_slug
                           AND sv.chapter_number = i.src_ch
                           AND sv.verse_number   = i.src_v
  JOIN _s156_xref_lookup tv ON tv.edition_slug   = i.tgt_edition
                           AND tv.book_slug      = i.tgt_slug
                           AND tv.chapter_number = i.tgt_ch
                           AND tv.verse_number   = i.tgt_v
 WHERE sv.verse_id <> tv.verse_id
ON CONFLICT (source_verse_id, target_verse_id, source) DO NOTHING;

