       'Matt 24:7-31''s walk-out of the substantial-signs-of-the-end-and-the-Son-of-Adam-declared substance — the substantial-deception-and-internal-betrayal at vv.9-12, the substantial-iniquity-shall-abound-and-the-love-of-many-shall-wax-cold framework-major direct-diagnostic of the substantial-modern-antinomian-gospel at v.12, the substantial-cosmic-signs *immediately after the tribulation of those days* at v.29, the substantial *sign of the Son of Adam in heaven* and *Son of Adam coming in the clouds of heaven with power and great glory* at v.30, and the substantial-gathering-of-the-elect-from-the-four-winds at v.31 — read against the wisdom-stream''s direct articulation in 2 Esdras (4 Ezra) 5 + 13. Five moves: 2 Esdras 5:1 names THE direct verbal-anchor for the signs-of-the-end-of-the-age substance (*the way of truth shall be hidden, and the land shall be barren of faith*) — the substantial-faith-substance walking-from-the-substantial-keep-of-the-commandments per 1 John 5:3, when the substantial-torahlessness abounds the substantial-faith-substance fails; 2 Esdras 5:4 names the cosmic-signs substance (*the sun shall suddenly shine again in the night, and the moon thrice in the day*) the King walks at Matt 24:29 with the substantial-Tanakh-Day of Yahuah (the LORD) cluster the prophets-Yeshayahu (Isaiah) + Yo''el (Joel) + Yechezk''el (Ezekiel) + Amos + Mikhah (Micah) + Tsefanyah (Zephaniah) walked; 2 Esdras 5:9 names the substantial-internal-betrayal-substance (*all friends shall destroy one another*) the King walks at Matt 24:10; 2 Esdras 13:32 names THE direct verbal-anchor for the *then shall my Son be declared* substance the King walks at Matt 24:30 — note at Matt 24:30 the Greek does NOT carry the *hōs* / *homoion* comparative and reads as the title *the Son of Adam* directly (the kaph-comparative narrow-rule preserved only at Daniel 7:13 + Revelation 1:13 + Revelation 14:14 per Red Line #12''s harmonized treatment); 2 Esdras 13:39 names the substantial-gathering-of-the-ten-tribes-of-Yashar''el (Israel) substance — the substantial 2 Esdras 13:40-47 unit identifies the substantial-peaceable-multitude as the substantial-ten-tribes-carried-away-by-Salmanasar (Shalmaneser)-king-of-Ashshur (Assyria), walking-through-the-substantial-waters into-the-substantial-further-country and gathered-back at the substantial-end-of-the-age. The substantial-substance is THE most-direct wisdom-stream corroboration of the substantial-paternal-blood-remnant-of-the-twelve-tribes the substantial-prophets walked the substantial-ingathering substance for — Red Line #11''s central anchor at the substantial-pseudepigraphic-register. FRAMEWORK-MAJOR. The framework reads the cluster as the substantial-direct-wisdom-stream-articulation of the substantial-signs-and-declaration-and-gathering architecture the King walks at the substantial Olivet-discourse.',
       sv.verse_id, ev.verse_id, 'complete_study', 344
  FROM _s156_xref_lookup sv, _s156_xref_lookup ev
 WHERE sv.edition_slug = 'canon' AND sv.book_slug = 'matthew' AND sv.chapter_number = 24 AND sv.verse_number = 10
   AND ev.edition_slug = 'canon' AND ev.book_slug = 'matthew' AND ev.chapter_number = 24 AND ev.verse_number = 31
ON CONFLICT (slug) DO NOTHING;

