att 24:30 Son-of-Adam-coming-in-the-clouds walks-the-public-visible-second-coming-substance into AND ties-back to the substantial-Matt 24:38 *eating and drinking* substance of the days-of-Noach (Noah); Testaments-Asher 6:7 names THE direct wisdom-stream verbal-anchor for the Yahuah-will-gather-you-together substance the King walks at Matt 24:31 (*for the sake of Avraham (Abraham), Yitschaq (Isaac), and Ya''aqov (Jacob)* tying-the-substantial-gathering-substance directly-to-the-substantial-paternal-blood-substance the Father had-walked the substantial-covenant-substance with-the-substantial-patriarchs at Genesis 12:1-3 + Genesis 26:3-5 + Genesis 28:13-15). The framework reads the cluster as the substantial-direct-wisdom-stream-articulation of the substantial-Mount-of-Olives-Olivet-discourse setting AND the substantial-paternal-blood-remnant-of-the-twelve-tribes ingathering the King walks at the substantial-gospel-witness-to-the-nations + four-winds-gathering substance per Red Line #11.',
       sv.verse_id, ev.verse_id, 'complete_study', 346
